description:
Laser FX Perfect Serum supports natural collagen and elastin production to make skin feel instantly smoothed and plumped while diminishing the appearance of lines and wrinkles. It promotes fibroblast renewal to soften the look of acne scars and create a healthier-looking complexion. This ultra-targeted and transformative serum improves skin texture and imperfections overall, revealing your best skin. <span class="a-size-small a-color-secondary">
        Cosmopolitan 2014 Beauty Award Winner: Best Anti-Aging Serum&#034;
